 "note": "The download holds each face twice, the same picture exported two ways: a lighter JPG with an sRGB profile and a darker JPG without a profile (lighter is about 0.93 x darker + 14.5 in level). The lighter sRGB copy is used for every face (J, 2026-10-04), turned upright where it is landscape. Face numbers are ABK's numbers on the lighter copy's name.",
